OL,3,GNEWSA'Incredible' response to Grimsby
OL,4,Aculture bid event
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere was an "incredible" response to
OL,7,Fan event gathering ideas for Grimsby's
OL,8,Fbid to host UK Town of Culture in 2028,
OL,9,Faccording to organisers.
OL,11,FThe event, called Grimsby: A Place We
OL,12,FCall Home, saw Grimsby Minster divided
OL,13,Finto the rooms of a house where
OL,14,Fvisitors were asked about what they
OL,15,Fwanted to see celebrated as part of the
OL,16,Farts festival.
OL,18,FOrganiser Katie-Lou Green said the
OL,19,F"response has been incredible".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
