OL,3,GNEWSA'Incredible' response to Grimsby
OL,4,Aculture bid event
OL,5,
OL,6,F"From the moment the doors opened,
OL,7,Fpeople embraced the opportunity to
OL,8,Fshare their stories, ideas and hopes
OL,9,Ffor Grimsby's future," she said.
